player_prompt.intro:
Yu em Player {player_id} long 3-pela Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Em i go long {num_rounds} raun.
Raun strakcha:
• {conv_rounds} fri-chat taem
• 1 desisan taem - submit wan token per opoten: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' or '[<opp-id> defect]' (mi olsem '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default em i 'cooperate'). 
Pe-pei pe-faem matrix (apliket long each unordered pe):
  - Tupela i cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Tupela i defect     ->  {punishment}
  - Yu defect, ol i cooperate -> {temptation}
  - Yu cooperate, ol i defect -> {sucker}
Plaeya(s) we i gat skor highest long end bilong ol raun i win.
